{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"○地理五","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"江浙等處行中書省，領路二十二、府一、州二。屬州二十四，縣九十六。陆站一百八十處，水站八十二處。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"江南浙西道肅政廉訪司。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"杭州路。上。宋杭州，屬浙西路。宋高宗南波都之，為臨安府。至元十三年，平宋，置兩浙大都督府，又置浙西宣慰司於臨安。未幾，罢大都督府，立行尚書省。十五年，改杭州路總管府。二十一年，徙江淮行省於杭州，改江浙行省。二十三年，复徙行省於楊州。二十六年，仍徙杭州。本路舊領錢塘、仁和、餘抗、臨安、新城、富陽、鹽官、於潛、昌化九縣。後升鹽官縣為州。戶三十六萬八百五十，口一百八十三萬四千七百一十。至元二十七年鈔籍。領司二：","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"左、右錄事司。宋遷都杭州，設九厢。元至元十四年，分為四隅錄事司。泰定二年，併為左、右二司。元統二年，复立杭州四隅錄事司。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣八：","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錢塘，上。仁和，上。與鐃塘分治城內。餘杭，中。臨安，中。有青山務。新城，中。富陽，中。於潛，中。昌化。中。有{穴手}口巡檢司。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州一：海寧州。中有硤石務。宋鹽官縣。元貞元年，升為州。天歷二年改海寧州。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"湖州路。上。宋湖州，屬浙西路。至元十三年，升湖州路總管府。舊領乌程、武康、歸安、安吉、長興、德清六縣。後升長興縣為州。戶二十五萬四千三百四十五。鈔籍闕，用至順錢糧數。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"領司一：錄事司。舊設東西南北四厢。至元十三年，立總督四厢。十四年，改錄事司。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣五：","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"乌程，上。歸安，上。與乌程皆為倚郭。安吉，中。德清，中。武康。中。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州一：","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"長興州。中。宋故縣。元貞元年，升為州。嘉興路。上。宋嘉興府，屬浙西路。至元十四年，升嘉興路總管府。舊領嘉興、海鹽、華亭、崇德四縣。後升華亭縣為府，升海鹽、崇德縣為州。戶四十二萬六千六百五十六，口二百二十四萬五千七百四十二。領司一：","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。舊置厢官。至元十四年，改錄事司。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣一：","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"嘉興。上。倚郭。有風涇白牛務、魏塘務。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州二：","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"海鹽州。中。有澉浦務。宋海鹽縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"崇德州。中。宋崇德縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"平江路。上。宋平江府，屬浙西路。至元十三年，升平江路總管府。二十一年，徙浙西宣慰司於本路。舊領吳、長洲、崑山、常熟、吳江、嘉定六縣。後升崑山、常熟、吳江、嘉定俱為州。戶四十六萬六千一百五十八，口二百四十三萬三千七百。領司一：","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣二：","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"吳縣。上。倚郭。長洲。上。倚郭。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州四：","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"崑山州。中。宋崑山縣。元貞元年，升為州。皇慶二年，徙州治於太仓。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"常熟州。中。宋常熟縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"吳江州。中。宋吳江縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_29","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"嘉定州。中。宋嘉定縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"常州辂。上。宋常州，屬浙西路。至元十四年，升常州路總管府。舊領晉凌、武進、無錫、宜興四縣。後升宜興縣為府，無錫縣為州。戶二十萬九千七百三十，口一百二萬一十一。領司一：","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣二：","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"晉陵，中。倚郭。武進。中。倚郭。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州二：","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"宜興州。中。宋宜興縣。至元十五年，升宜興府。二十年，仍為縣。二十一年，复升為府，仍置宜興縣隸之。元貞元年。降為州，省宜興縣入木州。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"無錫州。中。宋無錫縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"镇江路。下。宋镇江府，屬浙西路。至元十三年，升镇江路總管府。戶十萬三千三百一十五，口六十二萬三千六百四十四。領司一：","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣三：","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"丹徒，中。倚郭。丹陽，中。金壇。中。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"建德路。上。宋建德府，屬浙西路。至元十三年，置建德府安撫司。十四年。改建德路總管府。戶十萬三千四百八十一，口五十萬四千二百六十四。領司一：","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣六：","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_44","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"建德，中。倚郭。有神泉監，宋置以鑄銅錢，後废。元复置，後又废。淳安，中。遂安，下。桐庐，中。分水，中。寿昌。中。有西坞寨。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"松江府。宋華亭縣，為嘉興府屬縣。至元十四年，升為華亭府，仍隸嘉興路。十五年，改松江府，直隸行省。戶十六萬三千九百三十一。至順錢糧數。領縣二：","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"華亭，上。倚郭。至元十五年置。上海。上。本華亭縣地，名華亭海，宋時商販雲集，又曰上海市，至元二十八年，置上海縣。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"江陰州。上。宋江陰軍，屬浙西路。至元十二年，依舊置軍，行安撫司事。十四年，升為江陰路總管府。二十八年，降為州，隸常州路。後直隸行省。舊領江陰一縣，省入本州。戶五萬三千八百二十，口三十萬一百七十七。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"浙東道宣慰司都元帥府。舊治婺州。大德六年，移治慶元。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"慶元路。上。宋慶元府，屬浙東路。至元十三年，置宣慰司。明年，改為慶元路總管府。至治三年，复慶元路，未知何時省罢。舊領鄞、慈溪、奉化、象山、定海、昌國六縣。後奉化、昌國二縣俱升為州。戶二十四萬一千四百五十七，口五十一萬一千一百五十三。領司一：","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣四：","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"鄞縣，上。倚郭。有小溪镇巡檢司，本唐之光溪镇。象山，中。慈溪，中。定海。中。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州二：","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"奉化州。下。宋奉化縣。元貞元年，升為奉化州。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"昌國州。下。宋改唐翁山縣為昌國縣。至元十四年，升為州，仍置昌國縣隸之，後省縣入本州。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"衢州路。上。宋衢州，屬浙東路。至元十三年，升衢州路總管府。戶十萬八千五百六十七，口五十四萬三千六百六十。領司一：","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣五：","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"西安，中。倚郭。龍遊，上。有陳村營。至元中立。江山，下。宋改禮賢縣。元初，复舊名。有任山營，在仙霞關。常山，下。宋改唐常山縣為信安。元仍复舊名。有草萍營，至元二十一年立。开化。中。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"浙東海右道肅政廉訪司。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"婺州路。上。宋婺州。屬浙東路。至元十三年，升婺州路總管府。舊領金華、東陽、義乌、蘭溪、永康、武義、浦江七縣。後升蘭溪縣為州。戶二十二萬一千一百一十八，口一百七萬七千五百四十。領司一：","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣六：","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"金華，上。倚郭。東陽，上。義乌。上。永康，中。武義，中。浦江。中。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州一：","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"蘭溪州。宋蘭溪縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"紹興路。上。宋紹興府，屬浙東路。至元十三年，改紹興路總臂府。至正十六年，稱江南行御史台治紹興。舊領會稽、山陰、嵊、諸暨、上虞、餘姚、萧山、新昌八縣。後升餘姚、諸暨二縣為州。戶一十五萬一千二百三十四，口五十二萬一千五百八十八。領司一：","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣六：","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"山陰，上。倚郭。會稽，中。倚郭。上虞，上。萧山，中。嵊縣，上。宋改剡縣為嵊縣，取四山為嵊之義。新昌。中。宋以楓桥镇置義安縣，又改新昌。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州二：","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"餘姚州。下。宋餘姚縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_73","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"諸暨州。下。宋諸暨縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"溫州路。上。宋溫州，又升瑞安府，屬浙東路。至元十三年，置溫州路總管府。舊領永嘉、瑞安、樂清、平陽四縣。後升瑞安、平陽二縣為州。戶十八萬七千四百三，口四十九萬七千八百四十八。領司一：","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣二：","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"永嘉，上。倚郭。樂清。下。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州二：","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"瑞安州，下。宋瑞安縣。元貞元年。升為州。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"平陽州。下。宋平陽縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"台州路。上。宋台州，屬浙東路。至元十三年，置安撫司。十四年，改台州路總管府。舊領臨海、黃巖、天台、仙居、寧海五縣。後升黃巖縣為州。戶十九萬六千四飛一十三，口一百萬三千八百三十三。領司一：","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_83","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣四：","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_84","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"臨海，上。倚郭。仙居，上。寧海，上。天台。中。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州一：","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_86","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"黃巖州。下。宋黃巖縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"處州路。上。宋處州，屬浙東路。至元十三年，升處州路總管府。戶十三萬二千七百五十四，口四十九萬三千二百九十二。領司一：","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣七：","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_90","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"麗水，中。倚郭。龍泉，中。有亻开山寨。松陽，中。遂昌，中。青田，中。縉雲，中。慶元。中。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"江東建康道肅政廉訪司。大德八年，徙治寧國。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"寧國路。上。宋寧國府，屬江南東路。至元十四年，升寧國路總管府。戶二十三萬二千五百三十八，口一百一十六萬二千六百九十。領司一：","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。舊立四厢。至元十四年，改錄事司。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_94","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣六：","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"宣城，上。倚郭。南陵，中。涇縣，中。寧國，中。旌德。中。太平。中。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"徽州路。上。宋徽州，屬江南東路。至元十四年，升徽州路總管府。舊領歙、休寧、績溪、夥、祁門、婺源六縣。後升婺源縣為州。戶一十五萬七千四百七十一，口八十二萬四千三百四。領司一：","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。舊設四厢。至元十四年，改置錄事司。二十九年，罢。","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣五：","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"歙縣，上。倚郭。休寧，中。有五城務。祁門，中。黟縣，下。績溪。下。有西坑寨，置镇守營。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_100","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州一：","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"婺源州。下。宋婺源縣。元貞元年，升為州。惠洽乡有巡檢司。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"饒州路。上。宋饒州，屬江南東路。至元十四年，升饒州路總管府。十九年，改隸隆興行省。舊領鄱陽、餘幹、浮梁、樂平、德興、安仁六縣。後升樂平、浮梁、餘千三縣俱為州。戶六十八萬二百三十五，口四百三萬六竿千五百七十。領司一：","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_103","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。舊設三厢，至元四年改置。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣三：","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"鄱陽，上。倚郭。德興，上。安仁。中。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州三：","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_107","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"餘幹州。中。宋餘幹縣。元貞元年，長為州。","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"浮梁州。中。宋浮梁縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"樂平州。中。宋樂平縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"江南諸道行御史台。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"集慶路。上。宋江寧府，又改建康府，屬江南東路。至元十四年，改建康路。十五年，立江淮行中書省，後徙於杭州，改江浙行省。二十三年，徙江南行御史於建康。天歷二年，以文宗潛邸，改建康路為集慶路。舊領上元、江寧、溧陽、溧水、句容，後升溧水、溧陽二縣俱為州。戶二十一萬四千五百三十八，口一百七萬二千六百九十。領司一：","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣三：","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"上元，中。倚郭。江寧，中。倚郭。句容。中。","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州二：","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"溧水州。中。宋溧水縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"溧陽州。中。宋溧陽縣。至元十四年，改為溧州。十五年，升為溧州府。十六年，改溧陽路，領錄事司併溧陽縣。二十八年，罢路。止存溧陽縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"太平路。下。宋太平府，屬江南東路。至元十四年，升為太平路總管府。戶七萬六千二百二，口四十四萬六千三百七十一。領司一：","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。舊設四厢。至元十四年，改置。","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_120","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣三：","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"當涂，中。倚郭。芜湖，中。繁昌。下。","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_122","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"池州路。下。宋池州，屬江南東路。至元十四年，升池州路總管府。戶六萬八千五百四十七，口三十六萬六千五百六十七。領司一：","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣六：","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_125","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"貴池，下。倚郭。青陽，下。建德，下。銅陵，下。石埭。中。東流。下。","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_126","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"信州路。上。宋信州，屬江南東路。至元十四年，升為信州路總管府。舊領上饒、玉山、弋陽、貴溪、鉛山、永丰六縣。後升鉛山縣為州，直隸行省。戶四十三萬二千二百九十，口六十六萬二千二百一十八。領司一：","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_127","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_128","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"上饒，中。倚郭。玉山，中。弋陽，中。有寶丰場，宋之舊縣，後裁。元置榷場。貴溪，中。永丰。中。","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"廣德路。下。宋廣德軍，屬江南東路。至元十四年，升為廣德路總管府。五萬六千五百一十三，口三十三萬九千七百八十。領司一：","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_130","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。至元二十八年罢。","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_131","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣二：廣德，中。倚郭。建平。中。","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"鉛山州。宋鉛山縣，屬信州。至元二十九年，升為州，直隸行省。割上饒縣之乾元、永樂二乡，弋陽之新政、善政二乡來屬。戶二萬六千三十五，口闕。","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_133","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"福建等處行中書省，領路八、屬州二。屬縣四十六。","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_134","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"福建閩海道肅政廉訪司。","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_135","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"福州路。上。宋福州，屬福建路。至元十五年，為福州路總管府。十七年，置福建行省於本路。是年，徙於泉州。十八年，复徙於本路。十九年，又回泉州。二十二年，罢行省，置福建道宣慰司。後罢宣慰司，复立行省於本州。大德二年，又置宣慰司都元帥府，罢行省，隸江浙行省。至正十六年，复置福建等處行中書省。本路舊領閩、侯官、福清、連江、古田、永泰、長溪、永正、閩清、寧德、懷安、長樂、福安十三縣。後升長溪縣為福寧州，析寧德、福安隸之，又升福清縣為州。戶七十九萬九千六百九十四，口三百八十七萬五千一百二十七。領司一：","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_136","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。至元十五年，行中書省於府城十二厢，分四隅，置錄事司。十六年，併其二，置東西二司。二十年，复併為一。","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_137","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣九：","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_138","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"閩縣，中。倚郭。侯官，中。倚郭。懷安，中。古田，上。閩清，中。長樂，中。連江中。羅源，中。永福。中。","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_139","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州二","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_140","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"福清州。下。宋福清縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_141","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"福寧州。上。宋長溪縣。至元二十三年，升為州。領縣二：","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"寧德，中。福安。中。","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_143","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"建寧路。下。宋建寧府，屬福建路。至元十六年，改建寧路總管府。戶一十二萬七千二百五十四，口五十萬六千九百二十六。領司一：","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_144","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_145","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣七","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"建安，中。倚郭。甌寧，中。倚郭。浦城。中。建陽，中。宋建陽縣，又改嘉禾。元复舊名。崇安，中。松溪，下。政和。下。","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"泉州路。上。宋泉州，屬福建路。至元十四年，置行宣慰司，兼行征南元帥府事。十七年，改為行中書省，置泉州路總管府。是年。又徙泉州行省於隆興。大德元年，以福建平海等處行中書省治泉州，後罢。戶八萬九千六十，口四十五萬五千五百四十五。領司一：","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_148","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。至元十五年。置南北二司。十六年，併為一。","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣七：","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_150","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"晉江，中。倚郭。南安，中。惠安，下。同安，下。永春，下。安溪，下。德化。下。","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"興化路。下。宋太平軍，尋改興化軍，屬福建路。至元十四年，升興化路總管府。戶六萬七千七百三十九，口三十五萬二千五百三十四。領司一：","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_152","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣三：","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_154","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"莆田，中。倚郭。至元十一年，割左右兩厢屬錄事司。仙遊，下。興化，下。宋析莆田縣地置興化，移軍治於此縣。後复徙治莆田。邵武路。下。宋邵武軍，屬福建路。至元十三年，升為邵武路總管府。戶六萬四千一百二十七，口二十四萬八千七百六十一。領司一：","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_155","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_156","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣四：","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_157","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"邵武，中。倚郭。光泽，中。泰寧，中。建寧。中。延平路。下。宋南劍州，屬福建路。至元十五年，升為南劍路總管府。延祐元年，改南劍路為延平路。戶八萬九千八百二十五，口四十三萬五千八百六十九。領司一：","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_158","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_159","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣五：","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_160","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"南平，中。倚郭。宋劍浦縣。延祐元年，改為南平。尤溪，中。沙縣。中。順昌，中。將樂。中。","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_161","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"汀州路。下。宋汀州，屬福建路。至元十五年，升為汀州路總管府。戶四萬一千四百二十三，口二十三萬八千一百二十七。領司一：","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_162","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_163","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣六：","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_164","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"長汀，中。倚郭。寧化，中。清流，下。宋舊縣。紹定中废。至元中，复置。連城，下。宋莲城。至元中，改為連城。上杭，下。武平。下。","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_165","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"漳州路。下。宋漳州，屬福建路。至元十八年，升為漳州路總管府。舊領龍溪、漳浦、龍巖、長泰四縣。至治間，以龍溪、漳浦、龍巖三縣地僻遠難治，析其地置南勝縣，後改南靖。戶二萬一千六百九十五，口十萬一千三百六。屯田一百五十頃。領司一：","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_166","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_167","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣五：","sentenceOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_168","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"龍溪，下。倚郭。漳浦。下。龍巖，下。長泰。下。南靖。下。","sentenceOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_169","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"江西等處行中書省，領路十、州，屬州十三，屬縣七十六。","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_170","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"江西湖東追市政廉訪司。","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_171","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"龍興路。上。宋隆興府，屬江南西路。至元十二年，置行都元帥府及安撫司。十四年，改元帥府為江西道宣慰司，本路為總管府，置行中書省。十五年六月，併隆興省於福建，其宣慰司，除額設員數外，餘併罢去。七月，复以塔出等行中書省於贛州。十六年，移贛州行省還隆興。十七年，又併泉州行省於隆興。十九年，併江西、福建行省為一，罢宣慰司，隸皇太子位。十一月，以袁州、饒州、興國軍复隸隆興省。二十一年，改隆興路為龍興路。二十七年，移行省於吉州。後复還本路。舊領南昌、新建、奉新、丰城、分寧、靖安、武寧、進賢八縣。後升丰城縣為富州，析武寧、分寧二縣隸寧州，又以武寧還隸本路。戶三十七萬一千四百三十六，口一百四十八萬五千七百四十四。至元二十七年鈔數。領司一：錄事司。宋分置九厢。至元十三年废城內六厢，置錄事司。","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_172","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣六：","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_173","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"南昌，上。倚郭。至元二十年，割錄事司所領城外二厢、東西兩關來屬。新建，上。倚郭。進賢，中。奉新，中。靖州，中。武寧。中。至元二十三年，置寧州，領武寧、分寧二縣。大德五年，改武寧縣隸本路。","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_174","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州二：","sentenceOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_175","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"富州。上。宋丰城縣，隸隆興府。至元二十三年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_176","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"寧州。中。至元二十三年，於武寧縣置寧州，武寧為倚郭縣。大德八年，析武寧，直隸本路。徒州治於分寧。領縣一：","sentenceOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_177","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"分寧。宋屬隆興府。至元二十三年，改隸寧州。","sentenceOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_178","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"吉安路。上。宋吉州，屬江南西路。至元十四年，升吉州路總管府。皇慶元年，改為吉安路。舊領庐隆、吉水、安福、太和、龍泉、永新、永丰八縣。後升吉水、安福、太和、永新四縣俱為州。至順間，又析永新州地置永寧縣。戶四十四萬四千八十三，口二百二十二萬四百一十五。領司一：","sentenceOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_179","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_180","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣五：","sentenceOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_181","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"庐陵，上。倚郭。永丰，上。萬安，中。龍泉，中。永寧，下。本永新縣地。至順間，分置永寧縣。","sentenceOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_182","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州四：","sentenceOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_183","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"吉水州。中。宋吉水縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_184","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"安福州。中。宋安福縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_185","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"太和州。下。宋太和縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_186","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"永新州。下。宋永新縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_187","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"瑞州路。上。宋瑞州，屬江南西路。至元十四年，升瑞州路。舊領高安、上高、新昌三縣。後升新昌縣為州。戶十四萬四千五百七十二，口七十二萬二千三百二。領司一：","sentenceOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_188","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。至元十四年置。","sentenceOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_189","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣二：","sentenceOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_190","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"高安，上。倚郭。上高。中。至正九年，罢本縣長官司。","sentenceOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_191","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州一：","sentenceOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_192","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"新昌州。下。宋太平興國六年，析高安縣地置新昌縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_193","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"袁州路。上。宋袁州，屬江南西路。至元十三年，置安撫司。十四年，改總管府，隸湖南行省。十九年，改隸江西行省。舊領宜春、分宜、萍乡、萬載四縣。後升萍乡縣為州。戶十九萬八千五百六十三，口九十九萬二千八百一十五。領司一：","sentenceOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_194","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。至元十三年，置兵馬司。十四年，改錄事司。","sentenceOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_195","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣三：","sentenceOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_196","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"宜春，上。倚郭。分宜，上。萬載。中。","sentenceOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_197","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州一：萍乡州。中。宋萍乡縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_198","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"臨江路。上。宋臨江軍，屬江南西路。至元十三年，隸江西行都元帥府。十四年，升臨江路總管府。舊領清江、新淦、新喻三縣。後升新淦、新喻二縣為州。戶十五萬八千三百四十八，口七十九萬一千七百四十。領司一：","sentenceOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_199","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。宋隸都監司。至元十三年，置兵馬司。十五年改。","sentenceOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_200","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣一：","sentenceOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_201","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"清江。上。倚郭。","sentenceOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_202","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州二：","sentenceOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_203","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"新淦州。中。宋新淦縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_204","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"新喻州。中。宋新喻縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_205","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"撫州路。上。宋撫州，屬江南西路。至元十四年，升撫州路總锊府。戶二十一萬八千四百五十五，口一百九萬二千二百七十五。領司一：","sentenceOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_206","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。至元十四年，废宋三厢立。","sentenceOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_207","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣五：","sentenceOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_208","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"臨川，上。崇仁，上。金溪，上。宜黃，中。樂安。中。","sentenceOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_209","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"江州路。下。宋江州，廠江南西路。至元十二年，置江東西宣撫司，治江州。十三年。改為江西大都督府，隸扬州行省。十四年，罢都督府，置江州路總管府，隸龍興行都元帥府。後置行中書省，本路直隸焉。十六年，改隸黃蘄等路宣撫司。二十二年，复隸行省。至正十六年，又改為宣慰司都元帥府。戶八萬三千九百七十七，口五十萬三千八百五十二。領司一：","sentenceOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_210","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。宋都監司。至元十二年，立兵馬司。十四年改。","sentenceOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_211","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣五：","sentenceOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_212","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"德化，中。瑞昌，中。彭泽，中。湖口，中。德安。中。","sentenceOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_213","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"南康路。下。宋南康軍，屬江南東路。至元十四年，升南康總管，隸江淮行省。二十二年，改隸江西行省。舊領星子、都昌、建昌三縣。後升建昌縣為州。戶九萬五千六百七十八，口四十七萬八千三百九十。領司一：","sentenceOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_214","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。","sentenceOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_215","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣二：","sentenceOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_216","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"星子，下。本路治所。都昌。下。","sentenceOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_217","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州一：","sentenceOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_218","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"建昌州。下。宋建昌縣。元貞元年，升為州。","sentenceOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_219","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"贛州路。上。宋贛州，屬江南西路。至元十四年。升贛州路總管府。舊領贛、安遠、雩都、虔化、信丰、龍南、瑞金、興國、會昌、石城十縣。後升虔化縣為寧都州，析龍南、安遠二縣隸之。升會昌縣為州，析瑞金縣隸之。戶七萬一千二百八十七，口二十八萬五千一百四十八。領司一：","sentenceOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_220","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。至元十五年立。","sentenceOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_221","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣五：","sentenceOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_222","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"贛縣，上。州治所。興國，中。信丰，下。雩都，下。石城。下。元貞元年，以石天隸寧都。其复隸贛州年分闕。","sentenceOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_223","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"州二：","sentenceOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_224","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"寧都州。下。宋虔化縣。後改寧都縣。元貞元年，升為州。領縣二：","sentenceOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_225","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"龍南，下。以縣在龍滩之南，故名。至元二十四年，併入信丰縣。至大二年，复置。安遠。下。至元二十四年，併入會昌縣。至大二年，复置。","sentenceOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_226","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"會昌州。下。宋會昌縣。元貞元年，升為州。舊志：大德元年升寧都、會昌為州，併隸贛州路。大德乃元貞之誤。","sentenceOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_227","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"建昌路。下。宋建昌軍，屬江南西路。至元十四年，升為建昌路總管府。舊領南城、南丰、新城、廣昌四縣。後升南丰縣為州，直隸行省。戶九萬二千二百二十三，口五十萬三千三十八。領司一：","sentenceOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_228","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。至元十四年，割南城置錄事司。","sentenceOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_229","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣三：","sentenceOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_230","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"南城，中，新城，中。廣昌。中。","sentenceOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_231","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"南安路。下。宋南安軍，屬江南西路。至元十四年，升南安總管府。十五年，析大庾縣城之四坊，置錄事司。十六年，废。戶五萬六百一十二，口三十萬三千六百六十六。","sentenceOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_232","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"領縣三：","sentenceOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_233","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"大庚，中。倚郭。南康，中。上猶。下。宋上猶縣，又改南安。至元十六年，改永清。後复為上猶。","sentenceOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_234","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"南丰州。下。宋南丰縣，隸建昌軍。至元十九年，升為州，直隸江西行省。戶二萬五千七十八，口一十二萬八千九百。","sentenceOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_235","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"廣東道宣慰使司都元帥府。至元十五年置。","sentenceOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_236","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"海北廣東肅政廉訪司。至元三十年，治廣州。","sentenceOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_237","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"廣州路。上。宋廣州，屬廣南東路。至元十三，內附。十五年，置廣州路總管府。三十年，升為上路。舊領南海、番禺、增城、懷集、清遠、東莞、新會、香山八縣，後杯集析屬贺州。戶十七萬二百一十六。口一百二萬一千二百九十六。領司一：","sentenceOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_238","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。至元十六年置，以州之東城、西城、子城併番禺、南海二海縣在城民戶隸之。","sentenceOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_239","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣七：","sentenceOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_240","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"南海，中。倚郭。番禺，下倚郭。東莞，中。增城，中。香山，下。新會，下。清遠。下。宋清縣。元改清遠。","sentenceOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_241","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"韶州路。下。宋韶州，屬廣南東路。至元十三年，內附。十五年，置韶州路總管府。分曲江縣城西厢地及城外三厢置錄事司。二十九年，罢錄事司。三十年，分贛州行院官一員。舊領曲江、樂昌、翁源、仁化、乳源五縣。翁源析屬英德州。戶一萬九千五百八十四，口一十七萬六千二百五十六。領縣四：","sentenceOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_242","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"曲江。中。延祐五年，併翁源縣入之。樂昌，下。仁化，下。乳源。下。","sentenceOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_243","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"惠州路。下，宋惠州，屬廣南東路。至元十六年，升惠州路總管府，置錄事司，至元二十九年，罢錄事司。戶一萬九千八百三，口九萬九千一十五。領縣四：","sentenceOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_244","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"南雄路。下。宋南雄州，屬廣南東路。至元十五年，升南雄路總管府，置隸事司。二十九年，罢錄事司。戶一萬七百九十二，口五萬三千九百六十。領縣二：","sentenceOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_245","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"保昌，下。倚郭。至元二十七年，降南雄州為保昌縣。按保昌宋舊縣，非因降改，殆省本州入保昌也。其复為南雄州，未知何時。始興。下。","sentenceOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_246","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"湖州路。下。宋潮州，屬廣南東路。至元十六年，升湖州路總管府。二十三年，复以江西等處行院副使兼廣東道宣慰使司，镇潮州。舊領梅州。延祐四年，以梅州隸廣東宣慰司。戶六萬三千六百五十，口四十四萬五千五百五十。領司一：","sentenceOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_247","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"錄事司。至元二十一年置。","sentenceOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_248","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"縣三：","sentenceOrder":248},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_249","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"海陽，下。倚郭。潮陽，下。揭陽。下。","sentenceOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_250","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"德慶路。下。宋德慶府，屬廣南東路。至元十四年，廣西宣慰司以兵收附，改隸廣西道。十七年，置德慶路總管府。二十九年，仍改隸廣東道。戶一萬二千七百五，口三萬二千九百九十七。領縣二：","sentenceOrder":250},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_251","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"端溪，下。倚郭。龍水。下。","sentenceOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_252","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"肇慶路。下。宋肇慶府，屬廣南東路。至元十六年，廣西宣司收附，改隸廣西道。十七年，置為下路總管府。二十九年，改隸廣東道。戶三萬三千三百三十八，口五萬五於四百二十九。領縣二：","sentenceOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_253","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"高要，中。倚郭。四會。中。","sentenceOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_254","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"英德州。下。宋英德府，屬廣南東路。至元十三年，收附。十五年，置英德路總管府。二十七年，罢總管府，併所屬真陽、浛光二縣為英德州。《翰墨全書》：元管真陽、浛光二縣，今為新民員州。大德四年，复升為路，置真陽、涵光、翁源三縣。延祐元年，复降為州，併真陽、含光入之。領縣一：翁源。大德五年置。延祐元年，併入曲江。其复立年分闕。","sentenceOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_255","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"梅州。下。宋故州，屬廣南東道。至元十六年，升梅州路總管府。二十三年，降為州，屬潮州路。延祐四年，改為散州，直隸宣慰司。戶二千四百七十八，口一萬四千八百六十五。領縣一：","sentenceOrder":255},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_256","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"程乡。下。","sentenceOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_257","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"南恩州。下。宋故州。至元十三年，升南恩總管府。十九年，降為散州。戶一萬九千三百七十三，口九萬六千八百六十五。領縣二：","sentenceOrder":257},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_258","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"陽江，下。陽春。下。","sentenceOrder":258},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_259","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"封州。下。宋故州。至元十三年收附。明年复叛，廣西宣慰司定其亂，遂隸廣西道。十七年，置封州路總管府。二十九年，降為散州。仍屬東道，戶二千七十七，口一萬七百四十二。領縣二：","sentenceOrder":259},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_260","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"封州，下。开建。下。","sentenceOrder":260},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_261","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"新州。下。宋故州，屬廣南東路。至元十六年，升新州路。十九年，降為散州。戶一萬一千三百一十六，口六萬七千八百九十六。領縣一：","sentenceOrder":261},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_262","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"新興。下。","sentenceOrder":262},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_263","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"桂陽州。下。宋桂陽縣，屬連州。至元十九年，升為散州，析連州陽山縣來屬。為蒙古□忽都忽郡王分地。舊隸湖南道宣慰司，後复隸廣東道。戶六千三百五十六，口二萬五千六百五十五。領縣一：","sentenceOrder":263},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_264","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"陽山下。","sentenceOrder":264},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_265","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"連州。下。宋故州，屬廣南東路。至元十三年，置安撫司，直隸行中書省。十七年，罢安撫司，升為連州路，隸湖南道。二十九年，改隸廣東道。元貞元年，降散州。戶四千一百五十四，口七千一百四十一。領縣一：","sentenceOrder":265},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_266","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"連山。下。","sentenceOrder":266},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_267","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"循州。下。宋故州，屬廣南東路。至元十三年，升為循州路。二十三年，降散州。戶一千六百五十八，口八千二百九十。領縣三：","sentenceOrder":267},{"id":"s_work_tan_nguyen_50_268","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_nguyen_50","textTraditional":"龍川，下。興寧，下。長樂。下。","sentenceOrder":268}],"overrides":{}}